      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the end of the exhausting Monday shift, Vika brings in a fat stack of tips left by the grateful Chinese tourists. Chef Barinov hands the reward to Max, who asks to share it equally with the whole crew, right before Fedya announces he is giving one month's notice.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Понедельник день тяжелый.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну что.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Вот, ваши китайские чаевые.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Иди сюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
